L o =Unreduced design live load per square foot (m2) of area supported by the member (see Table 1607.1).

K LL =Live load element factor (see Table 1607.11.1).

A T =Tributary area, in square feet (m 2 ).

L shall not be less than 0.50L o for members supporting one floor and L shall not be less than 0.40L o for members supporting two or more floors.

