(Am. L.L. 2023/077, 6/11/2023, eff. 6/11/2023)K201.1 General.

As referenced in Section 3001.2 of this code, the provisions of ASME B20.1-2015 shall be modified in accordance with this appendix. The section numbers correlate to those in the referenced ASME standard. Refer to the rules of the department for any subsequent additions, modifications or deletions that may have been made to this standard in accordance with Section 28-103.19 of the Administrative Code.

