1.Pressure rating.

2.Beam strength (hangers).

3.Corrosion (chemical and electrolytic).

4.Resistance to failure when exposed to elevated temperatures.

5.Methods of joining (strength, permanence, fire hazard).

6.Availability of fittings (for sprinkler outlets and proper routings).

7.Physical characteristics relating to integrity during earthquakes.

8.Toxicity.

9.Combustibility.

