8.15.20.4.4 Delete and replace with the following: "In altering existing sprinkler systems which contain 3/4-inch (19 mm) pipe, the existing 3/4-inch (19 mm) pipe shall be removed and replaced with pipe having a minimum diameter of 1-inch (25 mm) except as provided for in 8.15.20.4.1, 8.15.20.4.2, 8.15.20.4.3 and 8.15.20.4.5."

Add 8.15.20.4.5 "Where nipples used are less than 1 in. (25 mm) diameter, nipples shall be schedule 80 and no longer than shoulder length."

