For SI:

V t

=

(0.000738T - 0.03348)V s

(P a /P f ) - (P a /P o )

where:

V t

=

Minimum volume of tanks (gallons) (L).

V s

=

Volume of system, not including expansion tanks (gallons) (L).

T

=

