P a

=

Atmospheric pressure (psi) (kPa).

P f

=

Fill pressure (psi) (kPa).

P o

=

Maximum operating pressure (psi) (kPa).

Where all necessary information is not known, the minimum size of the tank shall be determined from Table 1009.2.

