1302.3.1 Fuel-oil pipe.

Fuel-oil pipe shall comply with the standards listed in Table 1302.3.

1302.3.2 Systems serving appliances above ground above the lowest floor.

Piping for fuel-oil systems utilizing a transfer pump to appliances at levels above ground above the lowest floor or to storage tanks at levels above the lowest floor in buildings shall comply with the requirements of Section 1305.9.5.

1302.4 Nonmetallic pipe.

Nonmetallic pipe shall be listed and labeled as being acceptable for the intended application for flammable and combustible liquids. Nonmetallic pipe shall be installed only outside, underground.

1302.5 Fittings and valves.

Fittings and valves for the piping systems shall be compatible with, or shall be of the same material as, the pipe or tubing, and shall conform with Table 1302.5.

