(4)In any building exceeding 3 floors above grade, where the cable has an outer jacket of PVC, unless the PVC jacketed cable is concealed within non-plenum walls, floors, or ceilings constructed with materials providing a listed 1-hour fire rated assembly.Section 334.10 – Revise Items (2), (3), (4), and (5) in Section 334.10 to read as follows:

