a.The sum of 2 risers plus 1 tread exclusive of nosing shall be not less than 24 inches (610 mm) nor more than 25-1/2 inches (648 mm).

b.Treads may be undercut a dimension equal to the nosing. A nosing shall not be required when the tread depth is 11” (279 mm) or deeper.

