a.The minimum separation distance indicated is not required where exterior walls having a 2-hour fire-resistance rating without penetrations separate the storage from the exposure. The walls shall extend not less than 30 inches above and to the sides of Level 2 and 3 aerosol products.5106.1 General.

This section shall apply to the retail display of Level 2 and 3 aerosol products.

5106.2 Retail aerosol product displays not exceeding 8 feet high.

Aerosol product displays for retail sale not exceeding 8 feet (2438 mm) in height shall comply with the requirements of FC 5106.2.1 through 5106.2.4.

5106.2.1 Maximum quantity.

Only aerosol products being used for display purposes shall be stored for sale in retail display areas and the total quantity of such aerosol products shall not exceed the amounts set forth in FC Table 5106.2.1.

