6304.2.2.1 Oxidizing cryogenic fluids.

Outdoor storage areas for oxidizing cryogenic fluids shall be located in accordance with FC Chapter 55.

6304.2.3 Storage configuration for liquid and solid oxidizers.

Storage configuration for liquid and solid oxidizers shall be in accordance with FC Tables 6304.1.7(1) through 6304.1.7(4).

