16.In Section 7.4.3, insert at the end of the sentence "and shall be linked to the Fire Department's Operations Center."

17.In Section 7.5.1, insert "the Fire Department" after "AHJ or".

18.Add a new section, 7.9.4, to read "7.9.4 The location of portable fire extinguishers shall be conspicuously marked."

19.Add two sentences to the end of Section 7.16.1.1, to read "If required by the Fire Department, an engineering analysis shall be carried out to meet the requirements of Section 4.3. Such engineering analysis shall be filed and approved by the Fire Department. If required by the Department, a computational fluid dynamics analysis shall be conducted in accordance with the Fire Code."

20.In Section 7.16.1.2, insert at the end of the sentence ", and within 15 feet (4572 mm) of an emergency exit."

