By Council Members Sanchez, Louis, Feliz, Hudson, Gutiérrez, Farías, Narcisse, Nurse, Krishnan, Cabán, Bottcher, Schulman, Restler, Hanif, Brooks-Powers, Banks, Brannan, Ung, De La Rosa, Brewer, Won and Dinowitz

